title: "Competing-risks mortality prediction on NHANES: DeepHit vs Fine-Gray"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline comparing the DeepHit deep-learning model with the
  Fine-Gray subdistribution hazard model for cardiovascular and cancer
  mortality in the NHANES 2005-2018 cohort linked to the NCHS mortality files.
